{"id":190,"name":"aipom","speciesId":190,"dex":190,"form":"normal","generation":2,"types":["normal"],"stats":{"hp":55,"attack":70,"defense":55,"special-attack":40,"special-defense":55,"speed":85},"abilities":[{"name":"run-away","hidden":false},{"name":"pickup","hidden":false},{"name":"skill-link","hidden":true}],"height":8,"weight":115,"baseExp":72,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/190.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/190.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/190.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/190.ogg","genus":"Long Tail Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon de cauda longa","flavor":[{"version":"gold","text":"Its tail is so powerful that it can use it to grab a tree branch and hold itself up in the air."},{"version":"silver","text":"It lives atop tall trees. When leap­ ing from branch to branch, it deftly uses its tail for balance."},{"version":"crystal","text":"It uses its tail to hang on to tree branches. It uses its momentum to swing from one branch to another."},{"version":"ruby","text":"AIPOM’s tail ends in a hand-like appendage that can be cleverly manipulated. However, because the POKéMON uses its tail so much, its real hands have become rather clumsy."},{"version":"emerald","text":"Its tail ends with a dexterous, handlike appendage. However, because it uses the tail so much, AIPOM’s real hands have become rather clumsy."},{"version":"firered","text":"It lives atop tall trees. When leaping from branch to branch, it deftly uses its tail for balance."},{"version":"diamond","text":"It uses its tail to pluck fruits that are out of reach. Its tail is more adept than its real hands."},{"version":"pearl","text":"It lives atop giant trees. It wraps its tail around a branch so it won’t fall off while asleep."},{"